<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>CEMIG - Atendimento</title>

<style>
*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
}

html, body{
    width:100%;
    height:100%;
}

body{
    background-image:url('cemig.jpeg');
    background-size:cover;
    background-position:center;
    background-repeat:no-repeat;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    position:relative;
}

body::before{
    content:'';
    position:absolute;
    inset:0;
    background:rgba(0,0,0,.55);
}

.card{
    position:relative;
    z-index:2;
    width:100%;
    max-width:460px;
    padding:35px;
    border-radius:24px;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);
    backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
    box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.4);
    text-align:center;
}

.logo{
    width:220px;
    max-width:80%;
    margin:0 auto 25px;
    display:block;
    border-radius:12px;
    background:#fff;
    padding:8px;
}

h1{
    color:#fff;
    font-size:32px;
    margin-bottom:30px;
    font-weight:700;
}

.btn{
    display:block;
    width:100%;
    padding:16px;
    margin:14px 0;
    border-radius:14px;
    background:#0B6B3A;
    color:#fff;
    text-decoration:none;
    font-size:19px;
    font-weight:700;
    transition:.25s;
}

.btn:hover{
    background:#118A4C;
    transform:translateY(-3px);
}

@media (max-width:600px){
    .card{
        width:92%;
        padding:25px;
    }

    h1{
        font-size:26px;
    }

    .btn{
        font-size:17px;
        padding:15px;
    }
}
</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="card">
    <img src="cemig.jpeg" class="logo" alt="Logo CEMIG">

```
<h1>Atendimento CEMIG</h1>

<a class="btn" href="https://wa.me/message/W2QVTO554UQEI1" target="_blank">2ª via</a>

<a class="btn" href="https://wa.me/message/W2QVTO554UQEI1" target="_blank">Fatura digital</a>

<a class="btn" href="https://wa.me/message/W2QVTO554UQEI1" target="_blank">Negociação de dívidas</a>

<a class="btn" href="https://wa.me/message/W2QVTO554UQEI1" target="_blank">Fala com atendente</a>
```

</div>

</body>
</html>

